  "description": "Add a real-time diagnostics dashboard to any ASP.NET Core app with one line of code. CSharpEssentials.LoggerHelper.Dashboard embeds a zero-dependency HTML UI at /loggerhelper that shows sink health, live log stream, error history, routing config, and performance metrics — no Seq, Kibana, or external tools needed. Toggle sinks and change log levels from the browser. Dark theme, auto-refresh, mobile-friendly.",
